# Scripts and systemd units are executed and parsed on Linux hosts. A Windows
# checkout (core.autocrlf=true) must not hand them CRLF line endings: bash then
# reads the option as `pipefail\r` and dies at line 2 with
# "set: pipefail: invalid option name", and systemd misparses the unit.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf